+        {
+          "id": "AC-1",
+          "text": "The orchestrator appends one event per line to `<factory_root>/trace/<project>/<run-id>.jsonl`, outside every clone and outside the sandbox's write allowlist (a test asserts the path is not writable from a session). Event types: `phase_start`/`phase_end` for setup, implementer, L0, L1, L2 and publish; `tool_call` (seat, tool name, args, result snippet, ok, started/ended); `gate_check` (layer, item, ok, note); `session_end` (seat, tokens by component, cost, turns, model). Every event carries run id, task id, attempt number and a sequence number.",
